OL,3,GNEWSACouncil refuses to rule out tax
OL,4,Arise above 5%
OL,5,
OL,6,FA local authority aiming to plug a #27m
OL,7,Fgap in its budget has refused to rule
OL,8,Fout raising council tax by more than
OL,9,F5%.
OL,11,FBournemouth, Christchurch and Poole
OL,12,F(BCP) Council, which is run by a
OL,13,FLiberal Democrat-led coalition,
OL,14,Fannounced the forecast overspend in
OL,15,Fthis year's budget in August.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
